<title>NETHERLANDS: MOTORCYCLING-STARTING GRID FOR DUTCH 500CC GRAND PRIX.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-STARTING GRID FOR DUTCH 500CC GRAND PRIX.</headline>
<dateline>ASSEN, Netherlands 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Starting grid for</p>
<p>Saturday's Dutch 500cc motorcycling Grand Prix after Friday'</p>
<p>second practice session:</p>
<p>1. Michael Doohan (Australia) Honda  two minutes 02.512 seconds</p>
<p>(average speed 177.749 kmh)</p>
<p> 2. Doriano Romboni (Italy) Aprilia		   2:02.884</p>
<p> 3. Carlos Checa (Spain) Honda			  2:02.986</p>
<p>4. Jurgen van den Goorbergh (Netherlands) Honda  2:03.537</p>
<p> 5. Tadayuki Okada (Japan) Honda			2:03.827</p>
<p> 6. Alex Barros (Brazil) Honda			  2:04.308</p>
<p> 7. Nobuatsu Aoki (Japan) Honda			 2:04.620</p>
<p> 8. Luca Cadalora (Italy) Yamaha			2:04.656</p>
<p> 9. Jurgen Fuchs (Germany) Elf 500		    2:04.717</p>
<p> 10. Juan Borja (Spain) Elf 500			 2:04.749</p>
